              "printed_page": 1422,
              "column": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Possible intoxication of the vestibular receptors or inflammation of the vestibular portion of the vestibulocochlear nerve (cranial nerve VIII).",
