              "printed_page": 1422,
              "column": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Often incorrectly referred to as a stroke, geriatric vestibular disease is neither central in location nor suspected to be vascular or ischemic in origin.",
